<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>fmScoreRate__c</fullName>
    <description
  >26-10-19 점수율 = 총점 ÷ 배점 합계(배점 0이면 빈 값) — 과거 40점 점검표와 100점 점검표를 섞어 총점으로 평균내지 않으려고 by Kai</description>
    <externalId>false</externalId>
    <formula
  >IF(ruMaxScore__c &gt; 0, ruTotalScore__c / ruMaxScore__c, NULL)</formula>
    <formulaTreatBlanksAs>BlankAsBlank</formulaTreatBlanksAs>
    <inlineHelpText
  >총점 ÷ 배점 합계. 점검표 배점이 달라도 비교할 수 있다</inlineHelpText>
    <label>점수율</label>
    <precision>18</precision>
    <required>false</required>
    <scale>1</scale>
    <type>Percent</type>
    <unique>false</unique>
</CustomField>
